								</div>
								<h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white">Laravel Mail</h2>
							</div>
							
							<p class="text-lg text-white/70 leading-relaxed mb-6">
								A comprehensive email marketing and automation platform built for Laravel. Send beautiful campaigns, 
								manage subscriber lists, and track performance with real-time analytics—all from your own server.
							</p>
							
							<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
								<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
									<Icon name="ph:magic-wand-duotone" class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-400 mt-0.5" />
									<div>
										<span class="text-white font-semibold block">Drag & Drop Editor</span>
										<span class="text-white/50 text-sm">Create stunning emails without code</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
									<Icon name="ph:users-three-duotone" class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-400 mt-0.5" />
									<div>
										<span class="text-white font-semibold block">Smart Segmentation</span>
										<span class="text-white/50 text-sm">Target the right audience</span>
