								<div class="flex items-start gap-3">
									<Icon name="ph:figma-logo-duotone" class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-400 mt-0.5" />
									<div>
										<span class="text-white font-semibold block">Figma Included</span>
										<span class="text-white/50 text-sm">Complete design system</span>
